Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Wormhole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 40
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Its floral language is “a fresh start”. It must have sensed your courage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to bloom such a beautiful flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bamboo Node.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I haven’t let myself get in the way of your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the one who helped me finally find my Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be…that he wasn’t lying to me after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Overslept! I’m going to miss the trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.69,0:01:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuangzhuang has successfully evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor, what is that stone you took out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I just picked it up because I thought it was pretty; it doesn’t really have a use.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the multicolored fragment Weslie spoke of really exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you’ve become a flower,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,go ahead and do what you want to do. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mentor Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to tell Mentor Mei Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of bad guys trying to snatch that fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be dangerous for Mentor Mei Huahua to hold onto the fragment; the bad guys might target her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, all that’s left is to get that fragment down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.49,0:02:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Mei Huahua is so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Mei, please don’t hold onto that colorful fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Xi…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.92,0:02:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua said bad guys are coming to steal this fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Mei Huahua is very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not afraid of any bad guys who might show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.45,0:02:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have important business to attend to, so I’ll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Biting Grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How come your wings are…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How come your wings are…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How come your wings are…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,petals?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’ve seen them,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you’d better stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.42,0:03:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no—what are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put. Don’t ruin my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All troops, prepare!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you my newly upgraded mechanical arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Silt photosphere shot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t…don’t underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay now, Planie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hurry and move our leaves back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.39,0:04:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the King of the Flower Bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect Her Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.73,0:05:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s save the thanks for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s truly incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This King of the Flower Bugs…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it wasn’t nearly this big or fierce before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could the fragment be inside it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, everyone! It’s coming again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you…I thought you had left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting the Xilan Tree is our shared responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave things here to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the power of Light Cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out—it’s launching a sneak attack from underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s…it’s terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Can everyone hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do my part, too. If I can’t even fight off the Flower Bugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,how am I supposed to save my world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m clearly so weak—why am I trying to be a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I was, foolishly dreaming I could save my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no way I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who…who is speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Only by gaining power can you save everything you wish to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what you’re saying true?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…the multicolored fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re actually talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I am the energy of your world that vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.11,0:08:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take hold of me, you can escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and you will gain the power to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Me…save the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You certainly can, because it belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, take me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to witness you become a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:08:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel this immense power to your heart’s content.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, spit Planie out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.87,0:09:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what it feels like to have power?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We won! We actually won!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We won—Planie won!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Planie really this amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the fragment—he used the power of the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine; I just feel incredibly energetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m relieved to see you’re so full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? There’s a hole inside the wormhole?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t that lead directly to the Xilan Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the Flower Bugs planning to gnaw on the Xilan Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go in and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! There’s a bad guy here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do? How can I get out and tell Xi Huahua?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a Rocket Flower. Maybe I can use it to smash the cage open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, things never go as smoothly as they do in cartoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the nectar of the Corrosive Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I really managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be the Silt Tribe again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They cause earthquakes every other day; they’re just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now isn’t the time to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no telling what Mei Huahua might do to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get everyone’s help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.02,0:11:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s actually such a huge hole beneath the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,These marks weren’t caused by Flower Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks more like natural withering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Natural withering…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Could the Xilan Tree be sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.85,0:11:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, an earthquake is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hurry! Get out of here!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
